{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-7.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/bd/2006_CyMO-7.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-7.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"225\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/bd/2006_CyMO-7.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-7.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/b/bd/2006_CyMO-7.PNG/500px-2006_CyMO-7.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>In the figure, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/4369ccb938d86d296fe34bff83b078419be8aaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> is an equilateral triangle and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/5/485fa19d67d7a29716fd664b87d0c68834149ba2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\Delta \\perp B\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/5/3d54bb3d859157c24e44763e64e270e76164fd27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta E\\perp A\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"78\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/3/a33dec90f36ec1e97c8399834dac05e07c6d9a9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EZ\\perp B\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"80\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/d/4adefd04dc0b48e8fc2f52084a9a20871c209a34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EZ=\\sqrt{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"18\" />, then the length of the side of the triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/4369ccb938d86d296fe34bff83b078419be8aaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/3/9336799c0d66347fa1e844b51979ca50e47a62ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\frac{3\\sqrt{3}}{2}\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 4\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 3\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"370\" height=\"41\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/2/752b30e188e4c0b4b21ef6b680d918c2dcdfd9a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle EZ\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Right_triangle\" title=\"Right triangle\">right triangle</a>, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/7/607e06e9253bb64d452ca7b6cce72d52ad446241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Z\\Gamma = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{3}} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"110\" height=\"45\" />. Also <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/9/3490f5c6ed507a48cad03efca2b9f470287109db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ZE\\Delta = 90 - 30 = 60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"187\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/6/0b6318a389f411f4910665fbdca594d66cf59c67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ZE\\Delta$\" width=\"59\" height=\"13\" /> also is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/0/8f040866096861a91f1b9c755be19cf0849ae480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90 \\triangle$\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/9/0597fc723d6c3dad899b41161e529453c24edc20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta Z = \\sqrt{3} \\cdot \\sqrt{3} = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"147\" height=\"18\" />. Adding, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/2/f82ff88f2301b087f60d4db4bc721a731965c7f6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Delta Z + Z\\Gamma = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"14\" />, and a side of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/e/f2e71666c6431561891ac8d336fdc021b228e995.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle AB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/a/a1a8165479e8155584b7d14d1a189589a11799fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\Delta \\Gamma = 8\\ \\mathrm{(B)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</t